<p data-start="3204" data-end="3272" class="">Thought documentation (e.g., <em data-start="3233" data-end="3243">Playcosm</em>, <em data-start="3245" data-end="3258">SITH Theory</em>, <em data-start="3260" data-end="3271">GAIACRAFT</em>)</p>
