<li data-start="528" data-end="686" class="">
<p data-start="530" data-end="686" class=""><strong data-start="530" data-end="550">Semantic Atomism</strong>: Each S-Object is precise, purpose-built, and avoids fluff. Definition blocks, affordance maps, gate conditions‚Äîall are cleanly scoped.</p>
