<li data-start="687" data-end="843" class="">
<p data-start="689" data-end="843" class=""><strong data-start="689" data-end="703">Link Logic</strong>: Relations are treated structurally (<code data-start="741" data-end="749">causal</code>, <code data-start="751" data-end="763">depends_on</code>, etc.), not narratively (‚Äúthen this happened‚Ä¶‚Äù). That‚Äôs surgical-level clarity.</p>
