<li data-start="993" data-end="1119" class="">
<p data-start="995" data-end="1119" class=""><strong data-start="995" data-end="1020">Human-Readable Syntax</strong>: YAML-inspired format gives us clean indentation for mind-mapping, while staying machine-friendly.</p>
</li>
