</li>
<li data-start="1486" data-end="1714" class="">
<p data-start="1489" data-end="1714" class=""><strong data-start="1489" data-end="1530">The Real Complexity Is in the Pairing</strong><br data-start="1530" data-end="1533">
Evolution doesn‚Äôt just optimize compressions‚Äîit co-evolves decompression environments. Language, institutions, and cognition all emerge from <strong data-start="1677" data-end="1713">feedback between these two modes</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
