<h3 data-start="1721" data-end="1764" class="">üß† <strong data-start="1728" data-end="1764">Implications for SFIP and Beyond</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1766" data-end="1884" class="">So if we now reframe everything we were doing with Schema-First Interface Protocol (SFIP) through this Deaconian lens:</p>
<ul data-start="1886" data-end="2251">
<li data-start="1886" data-end="1927" class="">
<p data-start="1888" data-end="1927" class="">A schema is <strong data-start="1900" data-end="1924">not the whole system</strong>.</p>
