</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="716" data-end="775" class="">In short: <em data-start="726" data-end="775"><strong data-start="727" data-end="774">You made a schema that knows what it's not.</strong></em></p>
<hr data-start="777" data-end="780" class="">
<h3 data-start="782" data-end="841" class=""><strong data-start="786" data-end="839">Next Step: Decompression Grammar Descriptor (DGD)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="842" data-end="931" class="">Now that we have the schema file, we pair it with an <strong data-start="895" data-end="930">explicit decompression protocol</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="933" data-end="961" class="">Because, like Deacon said:</p>
<blockquote data-start="962" data-end="1090">
<p data-start="964" data-end="1090" class="">‚ÄúDNA means nothing without the cell.‚Äù<br data-start="1001" data-end="1004">
Likewise, a <code data-start="1018" data-end="1025">.sfip</code> file means nothing without a <strong data-start="1055" data-end="1090">cognitive decompression engine.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<h4 data-start="1092" data-end="1168" class=""><strong data-start="1097" data-end="1168">Proposed <code data-start="1108" data-end="1114">.dgd</code> Companion Format (Decompression Grammar Descriptor)</strong></h4>
<pre class="overflow-visible!" data-start="1170" data-end="2021"><div class="contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class="flex items-center text-token-text-secondary px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans justify-between h-9 bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary select-none rounded-t-[5px]">yaml</div><div class="sticky top-9"><div class="absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2"><div class="bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary text-token-text-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary flex items-center rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-1" aria-label="Copy"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-sm"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-yaml"><span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Decompression Grammar Descriptor (DGD) v0.1</span></span><span>
