<p data-start="3790" data-end="3836" class="">Would you like follow-up overviews focused on:</p>
<ul data-start="3837" data-end="3993">
<li data-start="3837" data-end="3869" class="">
<p data-start="3839" data-end="3869" class="">Playcosm &amp; predictive learning</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3870" data-end="3913" class="">
<p data-start="3872" data-end="3913" class="">Modality enforcement &amp; digital interfaces</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3914" data-end="3950" class="">
<p data-start="3916" data-end="3950" class="">Semantic architecture in AI design</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3951" data-end="3993" class="">
<p data-start="3953" data-end="3993" class="">Structural cognition and neurodivergence</p>
</li>
</ul>
