<h3 data-start="348" data-end="431" class=""><strong data-start="352" data-end="431">Modal Sovereignty and the Politics of Decompression: Interpretive Synthesis</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start="433" data-end="455" class=""><strong data-start="438" data-end="455">Core Tensions</strong></h4>
<ol data-start="457" data-end="1839">
<li data-start="457" data-end="778" class="">
<p data-start="460" data-end="485" class=""><strong data-start="460" data-end="483">Form vs Flexibility</strong></p>
<ul data-start="489" data-end="778">
<li data-start="489" data-end="612" class="">
<p data-start="491" data-end="612" class=""><em data-start="491" data-end="497">Meng</em> upholds schema as the stable epistemic anchor‚Äîa formalist approach grounded in clarity, logic, and universality.</p>
