<li data-start="1298" data-end="1450" class="">
<p data-start="1300" data-end="1450" class=""><em data-start="1300" data-end="1307">Kweku</em> complicates this by pointing out that sovereignty alone, if individualistic, misses the point‚Äî<em data-start="1402" data-end="1449">cognition is communal, embodied, and seasonal</em>.</p>
