</li>
<li data-start="1452" data-end="1839" class="">
<p data-start="1455" data-end="1499" class=""><strong data-start="1455" data-end="1497">Open Systems vs Structured Constraints</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1503" data-end="1839">
<li data-start="1503" data-end="1604" class="">
<p data-start="1505" data-end="1604" class=""><em data-start="1505" data-end="1514">Nexus-7</em> argues for open APIs and modifiable decision-weights as a path to scalable sovereignty.</p>
