<p data-start="1876" data-end="2022" class=""><strong data-start="1876" data-end="1908">No decompression is neutral.</strong> All interfaces carry assumptions. The ethical move is not to eliminate bias, but to <strong data-start="1993" data-end="2021">surface and negotiate it</strong>.</p>
