<p data-start="2025" data-end="2221" class=""><strong data-start="2025" data-end="2067">Relational ontologies resist encoding.</strong> Some knowledge cannot be compressed or replayed. This challenges interface design to <strong data-start="2153" data-end="2182">honor opacity and context</strong> rather than seek total representation.</p>
