<li data-start="2222" data-end="2360" class="">
<p data-start="2224" data-end="2360" class=""><strong data-start="2224" data-end="2275">Narrative, structure, and code are all partial.</strong> True epistemic freedom requires acknowledging that each form is both lens and limit.</p>
