<p data-start="726" data-end="811" class=""><strong data-start="726" data-end="735">Kweku</strong>: <em data-start="737" data-end="766">Interface as ritual ecology</em>‚Äîslow, place-based, honoring silence and kin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="812" data-end="879" class="">
<p data-start="814" data-end="879" class=""><strong data-start="814" data-end="822">Aley</strong>: <em data-start="824" data-end="850">Interface as open canvas</em>‚Äîplural, hackable, sovereign.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="880" data-end="961" class="">
<p data-start="882" data-end="961" class=""><strong data-start="882" data-end="893">Nexus-7</strong>: <em data-start="895" data-end="918">Interface as pipeline</em>‚Äîsurveilled, adaptive, frictionless, total.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="963" data-end="1016" class=""><strong data-start="968" data-end="1016">2. Educational Theory as Epistemic Alignment</strong></h4>
<p data-start="1017" data-end="1072" class="">Education becomes the proving ground for each modality:</p>
<ul data-start="1073" data-end="1436">
<li data-start="1073" data-end="1129" class="">
<p data-start="1075" data-end="1129" class=""><strong data-start="1075" data-end="1083">Meng</strong> offers logic puzzles and structural training.</p>
