<li data-start="1969" data-end="2041" class="">
<p data-start="1971" data-end="2041" class=""><strong data-start="1971" data-end="1997">Decompression Grammars</strong>: User-defined, situated meaning frameworks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2042" data-end="2114" class="">
<p data-start="2044" data-end="2114" class=""><strong data-start="2044" data-end="2071">Hackable Learning Tools</strong>: Where students reprogram their scaffolds.</p>
