# Symposium on Cognitive Infrastructure, 2025
# Location: A low-lit workshop room off the garden terrace, cluttered with whiteboards, haptic tablets, and a holographic projector. The air smells of cedar and solder. A tray of half-eaten honey-rice parcels sits forgotten.

