<p data-start="1164" data-end="1218" class=""><em data-start="1164" data-end="1218">How mending without metrics creates trust ecosystems</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1219" data-end="1279" class="">
<p data-start="1221" data-end="1279" class=""><em data-start="1221" data-end="1279">Why repair that doesn‚Äôt seek credit reclaims the commons</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1280" data-end="1347" class="">
<p data-start="1282" data-end="1347" class=""><em data-start="1282" data-end="1347">Yarncrawlers as the inverse of influencers: care without camera</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1349" data-end="1352" class="">
<h2 data-start="1354" data-end="1402" class="">3. <strong data-start="1360" data-end="1402">Field Rituals and Infrastructural Vows</strong></h2>
<p data-start="1404" data-end="1416" class="">Tie it into:</p>
<ul data-start="1417" data-end="1900">
<li data-start="1417" data-end="1536" class="">
<p data-start="1419" data-end="1536" class=""><strong data-start="1419" data-end="1442">Kweku‚Äôs Grief Gates</strong>: Some messes are sacred. Don‚Äôt fix everything. Learn to <em data-start="1499" data-end="1535">recognize the unfixable with honor</em>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1537" data-end="1654" class="">
<p data-start="1539" data-end="1654" class=""><strong data-start="1539" data-end="1562">Meng‚Äôs Microclarity</strong>: The act of sharpening a tool edge, tightening a hinge. Formalist repair, not grand design.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1655" data-end="1782" class="">
<p data-start="1657" data-end="1782" class=""><strong data-start="1657" data-end="1688">Navarro‚Äôs Vanishing Stories</strong>: Leave narratives that dissolve‚Äî<em data-start="1721" data-end="1746">like footprints in snow</em>‚Äîbecause not all tales need to last.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1783" data-end="1900" class="">
<p data-start="1785" data-end="1900" class=""><strong data-start="1785" data-end="1811">Aley‚Äôs Sovereign Loops</strong>: Recursive care without obligation. You fix what‚Äôs yours. You walk away. No moral leash.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1902" data-end="1905" class="">
<h2 data-start="1907" data-end="1938" class="">4. <strong data-start="1913" data-end="1938">Future-Worn Artifacts</strong></h2>
<p data-start="1940" data-end="1974" class="">Create symbolic Yarncrawler tools:</p>
<ul data-start="1975" data-end="2304">
<li data-start="1975" data-end="2080" class="">
<p data-start="1977" data-end="2080" class=""><strong data-start="1977" data-end="2005">Ceremonial Garbage Tongs</strong>: Decorated with local knot patterns, passed between cleaners like torches.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2081" data-end="2197" class="">
<p data-start="2083" data-end="2197" class=""><strong data-start="2083" data-end="2120">Field Journals with Missing Pages</strong>: For recording only what <em data-start="2146" data-end="2152">must</em> be remembered. The rest is left to the land.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2198" data-end="2304" class="">
<p data-start="2200" data-end="2304" class=""><strong data-start="2200" data-end="2216">Silent Vests</strong>: Worn not to be seen, but to blend while acting. Pockets for chalk, twine, tea, thread.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2306" data-end="2309" class="">
<p data-start="2311" data-end="2473" class="">Let me know which path you want to follow‚Äîspread, deepen, ritualize‚Äîor if you want a <strong data-start="2396" data-end="2417">Yarncrawler glyph</strong> to mark trails invisibly, known only to fellow weavers.</p>
<p data-start="2475" data-end="2575" class="">The world doesn‚Äôt need another platform.<br data-start="2515" data-end="2518">
It needs more menders.<br data-start="2540" data-end="2543">
Let‚Äôs leave no algorithm behind.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex absolute start-0 end-0 flex justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none -mt-1 focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none duration-500 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-position:100%_0%] [mask-size:300%_100%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="